      "duration": 72.166667,
      "segments": [
        {
          "id": "01-eight-heads",
          "end": 8.376,
          "start": 0.0,
          "title": "八个头，一份算力",
          "events": [],
          "narration": "多头注意力有八个头，可总计算量， 却和全维度的单头几乎一样。 多出来的头，难道不要钱吗？",
          "audio_path": "assets/audio/b90b597b7bebb8c74050ea0abc91858dfc83845aa8c4b1c51b7f11975c8e902c.mp3",
          "source_ids": [],
          "objective_ids": [],
          "visual_description": "full-bleed hero type on the cream grid; \"8 个头\" hard-swaps in place to \"≈ 1 份算力\", then the question line builds beneath it"
        },
        {
          "id": "02-averaging",
          "end": 17.784,
          "start": 8.376,
          "title": "单头为什么会\"压平\"",
          "events": [],
          "narration": "一个注意力头，只能给出一种关注方式； 它把不同位置的答案平均在一起， 就压平了同时关注多个子空间的能力。",
          "audio_path": "assets/audio/9c9c1c30ad2f90100523cbe3ea57e70f45fa4be03b1f8e2121627f3af6c87c48.mp3",
          "source_ids": [],
          "objective_ids": [],
          "visual_description": "split-screen of two mirrored cards — one averaged single-head column versus eight differently patterned subspace columns"
        },
        {
          "id": "03-formula",
          "end": 31.272,
          "start": 17.784,
          "title": "公式逐项组装",
          "events": [],
          "narration": "多头注意力这样做：把 Q、K、V 用不同的可学习投影，各投影 h 次； 每一份单独算注意力，得到一个头； 再把这些头拼接起来，乘上输出投影。",
          "audio_path": "assets/audio/f6bc1d34d12241c78a6ecd7f876efd2501c68dd2d9a840b7dccbb8a6b91a4b7f.mp3",
          "source_ids": [],
          "objective_ids": [],
          "visual_description": "the paper's two-line formula assembling term by term on the cream grid, with a 40% annotation rail"
        },
        {
          "id": "04-pipeline",
          "end": 41.495999999999995,
          "start": 31.272,
          "title": "数据怎么流动",
          "events": [],
          "narration": "于是信息在多条路上并行： 不同的表示子空间，不同的位置； 八个头各看各的， 最后拼回一条维度相同的向量。",
          "audio_path": "assets/audio/a9e09951a0e0dbb6714e0996f97f8513d7bf346b3f1f243f742ed52eff1d11d8.mp3",
          "source_ids": [],
          "objective_ids": [],
          "visual_description": "one horizontal pipeline on a full-width strip: Q/K/V → three projection stacks → eight heads → concat bar → W^O → one output vector"
        },
        {
          "id": "05-eight-by-64",
          "end": 52.67999999999999,
          "start": 41.495999999999995,
          "title": "8 × 64 = 512，算力为什么没变",
          "events": [],
          "narration": "原论文取八个头， 每个头的键和值都是 64 维， 正好是模型维度 512 除以 8； 维度切小了，总计算量就和全维单头相近。",
          "audio_path": "assets/audio/2ceaa213ebe7b7abfd85c3a8af7e3d154d4257910e18e7b584b37374adb18433.mp3",
          "source_ids": [],
          "objective_ids": [],
          "visual_description": "a data frame where the 512 dimension numeral splits into eight 64-cell pixel-stack blocks, set against one full-width single-head bar"
        },
        {
          "id": "06-ablation",
          "end": 62.087999999999994,
          "start": 52.67999999999999,
          "title": "消融实验说了什么",
          "events": [],
          "narration": "消融实验也印证了这点： 单头比最佳设置低 0.9 BLEU； 头太多、或者把键的维度切得太小， 质量同样会掉。",
          "audio_path": "assets/audio/7efc71acfe58dcee5f66b1996f98864697abdb704b3fec33a89d540234e91f97.mp3",
          "source_ids": [],
          "objective_ids": [],
          "visual_description": "an index-ledger frame with three rows of paper evidence, each with a mono delta"
        },
        {
          "id": "07-takeaway",
          "end": 72.14399999999999,
          "start": 62.087999999999994,
          "title": "一句话记住",
          "events": [],
          "narration": "所以多头不是把注意力做大， 而是把它分开看，再合起来。 并行关注多个子空间，然后拼接， 这就是它全部的秘密。",
          "audio_path": "assets/audio/7da7fe32d22d2d08a0374914fbc0e14bf16dc2819d920a90bf80f5b2bff69c5b.mp3",
          "source_ids": [],
          "objective_ids": [],
          "visual_description": "a calm closing statement on an otherwise empty grid — \"分开看\" then \"再合起来\", with the formula as a small mono footnote"
        }
      ]
    },
